| 1. INITIAL SETUP:                                                              |
| - Set binds controls in the script to match your in-game controller binds      |
|                                                                                |
| 2. MENU NAVIGATION:                                                            |
| - Open Menu: Menu Button + LT                                                  |
| - Navigate: D-Pad Left/Right to switch modes, Up/Down to adjust values         |
| - Toggle Features: D-Pad Up/Down to enable/disable mods                        |
| - Edit Values: Press A/X when "EDIT" is shown                                  |
| - Exit: B button to back out of menus                                          |
| - Toggle All Features: VIEW + LT to enable/disable ALL mods                    |
|                                                                                |
| 3. ADJUSTING RECOIL IN-GAME:                                                   |
| 1. Enter Menu (Menu + LT)                                                      |
| 2. Select Operators >  Select operator                                         |
| 3. Choose (Primary/Secondary) > Choose Weapon                                  |
| 4. Press A/X to enter adjustment mode                                          |
| 5. Use D-Pad Left/Right to switch between:                                     |
|    - VERTICAL (Up/Down adjusts)                                                |
|    - HORIZONTAL (Up/Down adjusts)                                              |
|    - DEADZONE (Up/Down adjusts stick sensitivity)                              |
|                                                                                |
| 4. MOD FEATURES:                                                               |
| - Rapid Fire: Adjustable speed and activation                                  |
| - Crouch Spam: Multiple behavior modes                                         |
| - Shaiiko Peek: Advanced lean technique                                        |
| - Shot Abuse: Quick ADS reset after firing                                     |
| - Jitter Mod: Micro movements Makes you look xim -                             |
|Warning: !!!DO NOT USE IN PUBLIC - This is because it is detected by mousetrap!!|
| - Crouch Shot: Auto-crouch when firing                                         |
| - Hip Lean: Quick lean from hipfire                                            |
| - Lean Spam: Rapid lean switching                                              |
| - PronePeek: Auto-prone when firing only (NOT WHILE ADS) Buggy Working on fix. |
| - T-Bag: Rapid crouch spam (hold LEFT)                                         |
|                                                                                |
|================================================================================|
|                    PERMANENT RECOIL SETUP INSTRUCTIONS                         |
|================================================================================|
|                                                                                |
| !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! |
| ! IMPORTANT: Recoil configuration takes time and patience!                   ! |
| !                                                                            ! |
| ! Expect to spend 10-20 minutes per operator to get perfect results.         ! |
| ! The more time you invest in tuning, the better your recoil control will be.! |
| !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! |
|                                                                                |
| To save your recoil settings so they persist when reloading the script:        |
|                                                                                |
| 1. Find these arrays in the INIT section:                                      |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
| 2. EXAMPLE: Adjusting Doc's MP5                                                |
|    - Find Doc in arrays                                                        |
|defenderPrimaryVerticalRecoil[4 * 3 + 0] = 19; <- This is the Vertical Recoil   | 
|defenderPrimaryHorizontalRecoil[4 * 3 + 0] = 1; <- This is the Horizontal Recoil|
|                                                                                |
| 3.Edit these values 0-100 range for vertical | -100 - 100 range for horizontal:|
|    - Positive vertical = pulls down (compensates recoil)                       |
|    - Negative horizontal = compensates right sway                              |
|    - Positive horizontal = compensates left sway                               |
|                                                                                |
|================================================================================|
|                          GETTING PROPER RECOIL VALUES                          |
|================================================================================|
|                                                                                |
| To find your recoil settings:                                                  |
|                                                                                |
| 1. Go to Shooting Range in-game                                                |
| 2. Fire a full magazine at a wall:                                             |
|    - Note vertical climb (vertical recoil)                                     |
|    - Note side-to-side movement (horizontal recoil)                            |
| 3. Start with default values in script                                         |
| 4. Make small adjustments (1-2 points at a time)                               |
| 5. Test fire after each adjustment                                             |
| 6. Recommended process:                                                        |
|    a) Set vertical until gun stays level                                       |
|    b) Set horizontal until pattern is straight                                 |
|    c) Fine-tune deadzone if needed (default 20 works for most)                 |
|                                                                                |
| Note: Perfect recoil control depends on your in-game sensitivity settings and  |
| weapon attachments.                                                            |
|                                                                                |
|================================================================================|
|                           PLANNED SCRIPT UPDATES                               |
|================================================================================|
|                                                                                |
| 1. NEW MODS COMING SOON:                                                       |
