|                                                                                |
|  - WEAPON SWITCHING:                                                           |
|    If your primary and secondary weapons get mixed up:                         |
|    1. Pause the game                                                           |
|    2. Press your bound weapon switch button                                    |
|    3. This should correct the weapon assignment                                |
|                                                                                |
|  - TROUBLESHOOTING:                                                            |
|    If scripts stop responding:                                                 |
|    1. Disable/re-enable the mod (Menu+LT)                                      |
|    2. Check controller connections                                             |
|    3. Restart game if issues persist                                           |
|    4. If menu isnt responding close and reopen it                              |
|                                                                                |
